   "section": "editorial.mission-text",
   "content": {
    "variant": "plain",
    "text": "We had to make arte.tv a reflex. Each poster turns a programme into one drawn-out word, PUTAIIIN for \"H24\" or PSCHIIIT for \"Coca, leader pollueur\". A line below gives arte.tv's angle. I art-directed the posters and wrote the lines. We won the pitch, but the campaign never ran."
   },
